<card id="c" title="Zla Kolata and Prokletije: 300 Euros There and Back">
<do type="prev" label="Back"><prev/></do>
<p>I&apos;d booked a tent pitch with meals: 25 euros a night. The price includes the pitch, toilets and showers, breakfast, dinner and a packed lunch to take with you, which you can pick up in the morning at breakfast.</p>
<p>All the food was cooked on site by the owners, mostly from homemade produce: really tasty homemade cheese, pastries, vegetables, beef, and no pork at all, which made me very happy. For that price, they feed you very well.</p>
<p>The owners are very friendly and take their work seriously. I didn&apos;t expect that level of service at a campsite in Montenegro.</p>
<p>On top of that, you can buy bottled water and other drinks right at the campsite. There&apos;s even cold beer, which comes in very handy after a long day of hiking.</p>
